    "body": "In the code, tsc is searched first, followed by tsgo. For large code repositories that use tsgo but have difficulty upgrading the tsc version, they may match a tsc version that does not support LSP. Therefore, it is necessary to prioritize searching for tsgo and confirm the tsc version",
